   "subtitle": "Part Three",
   "instructions": "說明：在這個部分，每題有(A)(B)(C)三張圖片，你會聽到一段兩個人的對話，一\n共有四句話，對話結束後有一個問題，請根據問題選出合適的圖片。每題念\n兩次，第一次念完以後先停五秒，再念第二次。第二次念完以後停五秒，就\n繼續下一題。",
   "instructionsEn": "Directions: In this test part, each test item has three pictures (A), (B), and (C). You will hear a dialogue between two speakers, with four sentences altogether. After each dialogue, someone will ask a question about the dialogue. Please choose the picture that best answers this question. Each dialogue will be read twice, with a 5-second pause in between each reading. After the second reading, you will have five seconds to mark your answer before a new test item begins.",
   "page": 13,
   "from": 41,
