   "grouped": false
  },
  {
   "title": "第四部分",
   "subtitle": "Part Four",
   "instructions": "說明：在這個部分，你會聽到兩個人的對話，對話結束後有一個問題，每個\n問題都有(A)(B)(C)(D)四個選項，這四個選項的內容也會出現在題本\n上。請根據問題選出合適的答案。每題只念一遍，選項念完以後停五\n秒，就繼續下一題。",
   "instructionsEn": "Directions: In this part of the test , you will hear a dialogue between two speakers. After each dialogue, you will be asked a question. Each test item has four possible answers (A), (B), (C) and (D) listed on your answer sheet. For each question, please choose the best possible answer. Each test item will only be read once. You will have five seconds to mark your answer before a new test item begins.",
